msgstr "``Id`` (자동 증가, 기본 키)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:263
msgid "``Name`` (Unique String with Character Constraints, e.g. “team_user”)."
msgstr "``Name`` (문자 제약이 있는 고유 문자열, 예: “team_user”)."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:264
msgid "``Display Name`` (String)"
msgstr "``Display Name`` (문자열)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:265
#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:696
msgid "``Description`` (String)"
msgstr "``Description`` (문자열)"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:266
msgid "``Permissions`` (String): Space-separated permissions names"
msgstr "``Permissions`` (문자열): 공백으로 구분된 권한 이름"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:267
msgid ""
"``Scheme Managed`` (bool): Indicates whether this role is managed as part"
" of a scheme."
msgstr "``Scheme Managed`` (bool): 이 역할이 스킴의 일부로 관리되는지 여부를 나타냅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:268
msgid ""
"``BuiltIn`` (bool): Indicates if this role is built-in to the Mattermost "
"system and not removable by the user."
msgstr "``BuiltIn`` (bool): 이 역할이 OKR.BEST 시스템에 내장되어 있어 사용자가 제거할 수 없는지 여부를 나타냅니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:271
msgid "Built-in roles"
msgstr "내장 역할"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/onboard/advanced-permissions-backend-infrastructure.rst:273
msgid ""
"The System Scheme is built-in to the product, and its roles are defined "
"as ``BuiltIn: true`` in the ``Roles`` table. You can use the Mattermost "
"API to `retrieve a list of permissions by role name "
"<https://api.mattermost.com/#tag/roles/paths/~1roles~1names/post>`__."
msgstr "System Scheme은 제품에 내장되어 있으며, 그 역할은 ``Roles`` 테이블에 ``BuiltIn: true``\ 로 정의됩니다. Mattermost API를 사용해 `역할 이름별 권한 목록을 검색 <https://api.mattermost.com/#tag/roles/paths/~1roles~1names/post>`__\ 할 수 있습니다."

